"author": {"steamid": "76561198867399693", "personaname": "DeadAgain1313", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198867399693/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 20012, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2400, "last_played": 1779000254, "avatar": "ac6dbdaf4a7ace5e2a753213755e99d0293c360f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Man, what to say about this game. It's come a long long way since I bought it, and since I last reviewed it, so I figured I'd rewrite my review, and I'm happy to say that in the time I've followed this game, It has only gotten better and better. The gameplay is just wonderful, and provides a good challenge even to good players, and the amount of content there is to unlock is crazy, from items, to enemy logs, to all the achievements, and the characters. Oh man the characters. Each and every one of the characters in this game feel completely different to play, all providing additional abilities to unlock over time, that completely change them so you almost never get bored. The level design is great, almost everywhere on every map is a wide open, yet beautiful space that feels fun to fight in. The maps, aside from being great to play on, also look great, and the art style really complements that. last but definitely not least, the soundtrack. Every song in this game is amazing, and I find myself often listening to the ost all the time. Overall, this game is an absolute steal if you like rougelites, and most people agree, is one of the better ones out there.\n\nUpdate: Survivors of the void is amazing as expected, more great RoR2 with some twists. Highly recommend.\n\nUpdate 2: Started modding the game, absolutely some of the most fun I've ever had in a game, also I can't wait for Seekers Of The Storm", "timestamp_created": 1605482247, "timestamp_updated": 1704569662, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79331370", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027755087", "personaname": "ZombieMesh", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ZombieMesh/", "num_games_owned": 495, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 21494, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9220, "last_played": 1786240583, "avatar": "c2bc06cdf699f267bf8aa09ff65c5142cc985e4e"}, "language": "english", "review": "A game that is different every time you play it. Struggle to survive each stage or become god and stop paying attention as everything dies around you.", "timestamp_created": 1605479974, "timestamp_updated": 1605479974, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79330761", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975283409", "personaname": "Osterlamm", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197975283409/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 10785, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6660, "last_played": 1769263797, "avatar": "1454c7d29372359bf8b4b3f42b4158b837f41c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really like this game but there is a pretty annoying bug at the moment. \nOn Abyssal Depths for some people the doors are closed so you cant leave the spawn.\nActually killed a few of my runs with friends recently. Hope it will get fixed soon.\nThe game itself is actually much fun to play with friends and even alone.\nIf you like dungeoncrawler and shooter at the same time this might just be a game 